<title>SOUTH AFRICA: RUGBY UNION-CURRIE CUP RESULT.</title>
<headline>RUGBY UNION-CURRIE CUP RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>EAST LONDON, South Africa 1997-06-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of a</p>
<p>Currie Cup rugby union match played on Sunday:</p>
<p>Griqualand West beat Border 13-5 (halftime (0-5)</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Border - Try: Richard Bennett</p>
<p>Griqualand West - Try: Albert van der Bergh. Conversion:</p>
<p>Franco Smith. Penalties: Smith (2).</p>
</text>
